## Independent checks

The isolated checkout was at the candidate commit, had no uncommitted diff,
and passed `git diff --check` for the base-to-candidate change.

The following tests were run from the exact clean isolated candidate and all
passed:

```text
python3 -m unittest -v \
  orchestrator.tests.test_workflow_runtime.ResumeCheckpointTests.test_history_budget_rejects_before_writes_and_accepts_exact_limit \
  orchestrator.tests.test_workflow_runtime.ResumeCheckpointTests.test_existing_over_budget_history_rejects_even_identical_replay \
  orchestrator.tests.test_workflow_runtime.ResumeCheckpointTests.test_history_loader_checks_size_before_read_and_bounds_growth \
  orchestrator.tests.test_workflow_runtime.TeamRuntimeTests.test_large_history_current_next_checkpoint_and_publication_base \
  orchestrator.tests.test_workflow_runtime.TeamRuntimeTests.test_large_history_continuation_keeps_other_read_limits \
  orchestrator.tests.test_workflow_runtime.TeamRuntimeTests.test_bootstrap_history_budget_precedes_remote_and_candidate_blob_reads
```

Result: 6 tests passed in 3.093 seconds.

```text
python3 -m unittest -v \
  orchestrator.tests.test_workflow_runtime.ResumeCheckpointTests.test_corrupt_recovery_exact_archive_preserves_bad_bytes_and_requires_reconcile \
  orchestrator.tests.test_workflow_runtime.ResumeCheckpointTests.test_interruption_at_each_durable_stage_replays_exactly \
  orchestrator.tests.test_workflow_runtime.ResumeCheckpointTests.test_writer_lock_collision_and_symlink_hold \
  orchestrator.tests.test_workflow_runtime.TeamRuntimeTests.test_compact_publication_intake_checkpoint_reserve_commit_push_confirm \
  orchestrator.tests.test_workflow_runtime.TeamRuntimeTests.test_bootstrap_publish_first_v1_remote_succeeds_without_force_or_lease
```

Result: 5 tests passed in 18.968 seconds.

The earlier 95-test log predates the candidate commit and was excluded as
evidence for its committed bytes.

